  <name>Antigravity</name>
  <summary>Agentic IDE from Google</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Antigravity is an IDE from Google built around AI coding agents.
      This is an unofficial Flatpak repackaging of the upstream Linux tarball.
    </p>
    <p>Notable features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Agents that can plan and carry out software engineering tasks</li>
      <li>Language server support for code navigation and completion</li>
      <li>Chrome DevTools MCP integration for debugging web pages</li>
      <li>Runs on Wayland and X11</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.google.Antigravity.desktop</launchable>

  <url type="homepage">https://antigravity.google</url>
